"""Measured GEMM schedules, keyed by the shapes they won on.

Distilled from the OSS and better-benchmark sweeps (GEMM heuristic 5e6dc27; a
winner needing split-K, a physical output layout, or an unsplit 2-D warpgroup
tile keeps its b90e101 winner).
Each shape lists its winner first, then other seeds measured on that shape.
BF16 shapes then add up to ten distinct schedule families from their
inference-v2 screens (benchmarks/select_gemm_schedule_families.py).
Canonical NT BF16 decoder schedules add their compatible measured seeds first.
Fields not listed take the defaults in :mod:`ayla.gemm_jit`.
"""
